      <td><a href="https://github.com/import-js/eslint-plugin-import/blob/main/docs/rules/no-restricted-paths.md">import/no-restricted-paths</a></td>
      <td>JS/TS</td><td><strong>No</strong> — deny-list of zones</td>
      <td>Directory→directory import bans</td>
      <td>New directories unconstrained; misconfigured zones fail silently</td>
    </tr>
